  "id": "ep01-s1-p1",
  "title": "Acci\u00f3n \u00b7 Black. Then a headlamp beam finds frost on a bulkhead, ",
  "description": "Black. Then a headlamp beam finds frost on a bulkhead, and a mural: a beach at sunset, and CAPTAIN CHILLY, a cartoon penguin in a space helmet, giving a thumbs-up to nobody.\n\nThe beam belongs to ROZ. Cream suit, the shipping line's logo half worn off, the penguin sticker on her helmet crossed out in marker. She walks. Actually walks: there's a floor tonight, the drum is spinning, and her boots land on rail tracks with a dull transmitted thud.\n\nBehind her a container the size of a garden shed rides the rail on a cradle, pushed by EARL (dark grey, weld patches, a lanyard of keys tapping his chest) and NNAMDI (tug-company orange, NNAMDI hand-lettered on a strip of tape over his old employer's name). Straps everywhere. Thirty-nine more containers in two long ranks down the bay.",
